Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:03.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,684)\fad(80,60)}Running a {\c&H0084C5F4&}cloud kitchen{\c&H00E5F1F6&} can be chaos.
