Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:43.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,684)\fad(80,60)}Then {\c&H0084C5F4&}eighteen confirmed{\c&H00E5F1F6&} paneer bowl orders arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:45.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,684)\fad(80,60)}Now the {\c&H0084C5F4&}plan changes{\c&H00E5F1F6&}.
